{"articleNo":"142496","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=142496&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015학년도 전기 조기졸업 신청 안내문","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.12.22","hit":"4291","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 521px; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; HEIGHT: 69px; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #5d5d5d 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #5d5d5d 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 396.9pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 29.31pt; BORDER-TOP: #5d5d5d 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #5d5d5d 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: HY울릉도M; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; text-shadow: auto; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span></span></strong></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: HY울릉도M; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; text-shadow: auto; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2015학년도 전기 조기졸업 신청 안내문</span></span></span></strong></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 2015학년도 전기 조기졸업 신청에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 안내하오니</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">희망 하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 관련규정 : 학사운영규정 제186조[조기졸업]</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 신청기간 : 2016. 1. 11.(월) ~ 1. 12.(화)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 신청장소 : 해당 종합학사행정실</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 신청서류 : 조기졸업신청서 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 신청 자격 및 선발절차</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 가. 졸업을 희망하는 학기에 조기졸업 신청</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 6학기(건축학부, 건축학전공은 8학기) 이상을 등록하고, 졸업요건을 충족한 자로서 전 학년 성적 평점 평균 4.30 이상인 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학·석사연계과정자로서 7학기(건축학부, 건축학전공은 9학기) 이상을 등록하고, 졸업요건을 충족한 자로서 전 학년 성적 평점평균이 3.50 이상인 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 징계를 받지 아니한 자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 나. 소속 학과장의 추천을 받아 선정</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2015. 12.</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">교 무 처 장</span></span></strong></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -42.1pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span>·</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
